        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "The lime juice firms and flavours the fish rather than cooking it with heat. Use sushi-grade or day-boat fresh cod. Do not marinate for more than 30 minutes or the texture becomes rubbery." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
